#. <CLT 4>雑誌棚だ…
#. ボクが気になる雑誌はないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That same shelf full of magazines... None of them seem\n"
"all that interesting to me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは、オセロか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That same copy of Othello...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>事件には…関係ないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's not really related to the case, though.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ダーツ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That same dartboard...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>事件には…関係ないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's not really related to the case, though.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ビリヤードだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That same pool table...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>事件には…関係ないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's not really related to the case, though.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーがある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That same locker...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>気になる点は…特にないかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see anything worth worrying about here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình không thấy có gì đáng để bận tâm ở đây cả.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ソファーだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The couch...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>気になる点は…特にないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see anything worth worrying about here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình không thấy có gì đáng để bận tâm ở đây cả.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ここのテーブルには…
#. 事件の手掛かりになる物はないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>On the table is...nothing that could be considered\n"
"helpful.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、ビンみたいだけど…
#. なんなんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's some kind of bottle. But what's the point of\n"
"it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>よくわからないけど…
#. インテリアなんだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe it's just for decoration or something...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có lẽ nó chỉ dùng để trang trí hay đại loại thế...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. はい
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0016 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
